  "title": "Four- or Eight-Cycles in Twelve-Vertex Two-Attachment Graphs",
  "batch_label": "66",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For every connected simple graph H on exactly twelve vertices with distinct ordered terminals s,t, if deg_H(s)=deg_H(t)=2, every other vertex has degree 3, and dist_H(s,t)>=3, then H contains a simple cycle of length four or a simple cycle of length eight.",
